  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Wolfeboro, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Visitors   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t DMV Appointment Scheduling \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t\t Dog License Form \r\n\t\t\t Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t AquaTherm Application (Thin Ice Signs) \r\n\t\t\t\t Birth Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Death Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Divorce Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Dredge & Fill Permits \r\n\t\t\t\t Marriage Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t How to Use Computer / Device Fillable Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t How to Digitally Sign a Fillable Form \r\n\t\t\t\t Non-Resident Affidavit \r\n\t\t\t\t Residency Form \r\n\t\t\t\t Application For Vanity Plates \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Passports \r\n\t\t\t Town Ordinances \r\n\t\t\t Town Reports \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nMission & Purpose \nWhile roles and responsibilities may vary from city to city and town to town, the Municipal Clerk's commitment to their profession remains steadfast, providing the highest level of service to all customers. It is hoped that clerks develop, maintain, and refine the knowledge base required to serve their customer. The clerks around the state should participate in educational prog rams specifically designed for their profession, upholding honest principles, ever conscious that public office is a public trust. Clerks should possess high, consistent standards of conduct; fairness, respect, responsibility; trust, and above all confidentiality. Remembering that a code of ethics will not solve all ethical problems. \n\"But, we must remember that good laws, if they are not obeyed, do not constitute good government. Hence there are two parts of good government; one is the actual obedience of citizens to the laws the other part is the goodness of the laws why they obey..\" (Aristotle, Politics 1292a3-6) \nFAQs \r\n                 How do I request an absentee ballot? \r\nFill out the absentee ballot request form. Completed  ballot request forms only  (not ballots!) may be placed in the drop box located in the rear parking lot of the Town Office, in an envelope addressed to the Town Clerk, or mailed to: \nPatricia M. Waterman, CTC \nP.O. Box 1207 \nWolfeboro, NH 03894 \nPlease note that to return your completed  ballot , you  cannot  use the drop box; ballots  must  be returned by mail or in person to the  Town Clerk's office . \r\n                 How do I obtain a dog license? \r\nView information about  dog licenses . \r\n                 How do I register a vehicle? \r\nSee details about  motor vehicle registration . \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tPatricia M. Waterman\r\nTown Clerk \r\nContact Patricia M. Waterman \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 84 S Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Wolfeboro ,  NH   03894 \r\n84 S Main Street  Wolfeboro NH 03894 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t P.O. Box 1207 \n\t\t\t\t\t Wolfeboro ,  NH   03894 \r\nPhone:  603-569-5328 \r\nHours \nMonday through Friday \n8 am to 1 pm and 2 pm to 4 pm \n( Closed for Lunch : 1 to 2 pm ) \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t\t\tGina Curran\r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nContact Gina Curran \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Town Calendar \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Recreation \nLearn more \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Wolfeboro \r\n84 S Main Street \r\nP.O. Box 629 \r\nWolfeboro, New Hampshire 03894 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Public Notices \n         Hours \n         Property Tax Bills \n         Pay Utility Bills \n         Bids & RFPs \n         Employment Opportunities \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Website Sign-In \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n         Disclaimer \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
